  "goodToKnow": "Die Wildnis is wilderness: in der Wildnis überleben. Germany is densely populated and has little true wilderness, but its national parks follow the principle Natur Natur sein lassen (let nature be nature). The Bavarian Forest became Germany's first national park in 1970, where forest is left to regenerate after bark-beetle damage. Wolves, lynx and beavers have returned. Das Wild means game animals. Plural: die Wildnisse."
